Recovery Link Expired

Hi there,

The account recovery link you tried to use has expired or is no longer valid.

For security reasons, recovery links expire after a set period of time.

What to do next:
- Return to the login page
- Click "Forgot password?" or "Recover account"
- Enter your email address to receive a new recovery link
- Use the new link within the time limit to reset your password

If you continue to experience issues, please contact our support team.

---

If you didn't request this account recovery, please secure your account immediately and contact support.